local DataStorage = {}
function DataStorage.saveData(key, value)
if type(key) ~= "string" then return end
if writefile then
pcall(function()
writefile("alt_farm_" .. key .. ".txt", tostring(value))
end)
end
end
function DataStorage.loadData(key)
if type(key) ~= "string" then return nil end
if readfile then
local ok, res = pcall(function()
return readfile("alt_farm_" .. key .. ".txt")
end)
if ok and res then
return res
end
end
return nil
end

